  "body": "Stacked on #967 (which stacks on #965). Effort: medium. Fork synced at v0.17.0.\n\n## What changed\n`git mv` of the 12 test files that need nothing from `camcraft-app` into the crate that owns the behaviour (#919 research, Q2). Imports now name the owner crate; Gate maps name the real crate (`app::posting` / `app::machine` / `app::geometry` references dropped). No new crate dependency and no new dev-dependency; paths via `CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR/../../` and `include_str!(\"../../../assets/...\")` resolve identically from the new crates, goldens are still read from `crates/app/tests/golden` (nothing copied).\n\n`#[test]` count per file (before = after):\n\n| file | from | to | tests |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| heidenhain_arc_centre | app | post | 2 |\n| heidenhain_block_form | app | post | 5 |\n| heidenhain_cycles | app | post | 11 |\n| probe_spindle | app | post | 2 |\n| probe_spindle_stop | app | post | 2 |\n| comment_escape | app | post | 3 |\n| lathe_post_refusals | app | post | 6 |\n| doosan_dnm_post | app | post | 7 |\n| boundary_walls | app | sim | 2 |\n| arcs | app | motion | 7 |\n| real_tip | motion | sim | 3 |\n| origin_approach | motion | cl | 5 |\n\nTotal 55 before and after.\n\n`origin_approach` scans the motion generators' source for the seed pattern; its walk root is now `../motion/src` (a file-system path, no crate dependency). Caveat: a change that touches only `crates/motion/src` no longer selects it in quick (cl owns it now); batch and release still run it.\n\n## xtask\nBatch picks the moved suites up in their new crates (`--dry-run` shows post/sim/motion/cl step lists). Three quick-selection pins asserted the heidenhain suites under the app step; they now assert them under the post step. New pin `moved_suites_live_in_their_owner_crate_and_not_in_app`. `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` bumped to 19 (#967 has 18).\n\n## Tested\n- post: 8 moved suites pass (2/5/11/2/2/3/6/7); sim: boundary_walls 2, real_tip 3; motion: arcs 7; cl: origin_approach 5.\n- `cargo test -p xtask`: 43 passed.\n- clippy -D warnings: post, sim, motion, cl, xtask all-targets; app tests (`--tests`).\n- Not run: the full batch tier, ui suites.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #921\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL\n",
